      "en": "• Two types of facial expression parts are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• バトル演出を盛り上げるエフェクトパーツと各種ハンドパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with effect parts and various hand parts to enliven the battle performance."
    }
